SUMMARY:Garden Table Dinner Series at Quivira Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Experience a seasonal garden dinner at Quivira Vineyards\, set within their organic estate gardens. Held May 1–December 4 from 6–9 PM\, this thoughtfully curated series highlights just-harvested ingredients and locally sourced provisions\, paired with rare library wines reserved exclusively for guests.    Each evening features a unique culinary theme—from Moroccan and Spanish to Italian\, Cajun\, and a festive Holiday Dinner\, celebrating global flavors through a garden-to-table approach.    Designed to bring people together\, these dinners offer a memorable blend of great food\, exceptional wine\, and meaningful connection in a beautiful vineyard setting.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/garden-table-dinner-series-at-quivira-vineyards/
LOCATION:4900 West Dry Creek Road, Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
GEO:-122.938042;38.656225
CATEGORIES:Dining,Drink,Food,Food & Wine,Food and Wine Pairing,Sonoma County,Wine
