SUMMARY:Culinary Garden Cooking Classes at Quivira Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Join an immersive\, hands-on culinary series at Quivira Vineyards\, offered June 7–November 15 from 11 AM - 2 PM. Led by Estate Chef Julia\, guests begin in the organic estate garden harvesting seasonal ingredients before moving to the open-air kitchen to prepare a garden-inspired\, multi-course meal.    This interactive experience highlights the connection between garden\, vineyard\, and kitchen\, while teaching practical culinary techniques. The evening concludes with a shared meal paired with Quivira wines in a beautiful estate setting.    Each date features a different focus\, including handmade pasta\, masa and tacos\, stuffed pasta\, global dumplings\, and seasonal pie baking.    Space is limited for these unique seasonal classes.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/culinary-garden-cooking-classes-at-quivira-vineyards/
LOCATION:4900 West Dry Creek Road, Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
GEO:-122.938042;38.656225
