SUMMARY:Country Summer Music Festival
DESCRIPTION:Country Summer Music Festival returns to Santa Rosa June 12–14 with three days of live country music\, festival food\, dancing\, and Wine Country fun at the Sonoma County Fairgrounds. The 2026 lineup features headliners including Keith Urban\, Cole Swindell\, and Koe Wetzel\, along with more than 20 performers across multiple stages.    Guests can choose from single-day tickets or discounted three-day passes\, with options including general admission\, reserved seating\, VIP upgrades\, camping\, and exclusive viewing experiences. The festival also features local food and beverage vendors\, line dancing\, games\, and community activities\, creating one of Northern California’s biggest country music celebrations.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/country-summer-music-festival/
LOCATION:1450 Bennett Valley Rd, , Santa Rosa, CA, 95404, United States
CATEGORIES:Dancing,Fairs & Festivals,Family Friendly,Food,Live Music,Music,Outdoors,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
